  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Climate Resilient Coastal Ecosystems in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to increase ocean science to build climate resilient coastal ecosystems for a sustainable Pacific delivered by and for Pacific SIDS based organisations and individuals. The impact of delivering this work will increase investment and governmental engagement in ocean science across Pacific SIDS territories. It will increase capacity in marine science and related sectors, as well as training opportunities. It will safeguard Indigenous and local knowledge, subsistence resources, and human wellbeing. Finally, it will increase global awareness of ocean challenges and solutions facing and delivered by SIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
